  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Butterfinger pie is a no-bake dream that marries creamy richness with the craveable crunch of candy bars. A buttery graham cracker crust cradles a light, fluffy mousse folded with crushed Butterfinger pieces, so every forkful hits that smooth-meets-crunchy contrast. Finished with billows of whipped cream and extra candy on top, it serves up sweet peanut butter–caramel notes with just a whisper of salt. Quick to pull together and a guaranteed hit for holidays, potlucks, or low-key family nights, Butterfinger pie disappears moments after it lands on the table.<br></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-butterfinger-pie\">Why You’ll Love This BUTTERFINGER PIE</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-butterfinger-pie\">How to Make BUTTERFINGER PIE</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-butterfinger-pie\">Pro Tips for Making BUTTERFINGER PIE</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-butterfinger-pie\">How to Serve this BUTTERFINGER PIE</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-butterfinger-pie\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This BUTTERFINGER PIE</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Decadent layers of creamy peanut butter and chocolate.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to whip up for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly satisfies your sweet tooth cravings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Impressive dessert that will wow your guests.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-4442\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"4442\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-mead